        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "35-2-2-1 A teacher who experiences an illness of five (5) or fewer days and does not have the number of accrued sick leave days to cover the illness shall be automatically advanced up to the number of days necessary. This advancement shall not exceed five (5) days during one (1) academic work year to supplement his/her accrued balance of sick leave to provide paid coverage during the period of illness.",
